<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O blessed life, the mind that sees,</l><l>Whatever change the years may bring,</l><l>A mercy still in everything,</l><l>And shining through all mysteries.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O blessed life, as spirit soars,</l><l>When sense of mortal sight is dim,</l><l>Beyond the sense, beyond to Him,</l><l>Whose love unlocks the glorious doors.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O blessed life, heart, mind, and soul,</l><l>From self-born aims and wishes free,</l><l>In all at one with Deity,</l><l>And loyal to the Lord’s control.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O life, how blessed, how divine,</l><l>High life, the earnest of a higher;</l><l>Savior, fulfil my deep desire,</l><l>And let this blessed life be mine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
